intro.trace:
int a = 100000, b = 100000;

long long r = a * b;
   a * b is worked out in an int box
   true answer    10000000000
   int limit       2147483647
   what you get    1410065408   <- wrong

long long r = 1LL * a * b;
   1LL makes the first step long long
   what you get   10000000000   <- right
